{
  "id": "DEU.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Giipkeata Diigheanda 4",
  "verseCount": 49,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa goorgweaksiina fuga Israeli iita mureeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi ghamneawa Ea Israeli, asisiina mureeda digheanyeeka sean earukuneegwa anaaleagwa agooga, asisiina mureeda, ak ghoanyaschi giibinda, ak gooweayi ak goombali ng'eanyiida gooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoahaachi ng'asheanda earukuneegwa nea adiidu ghoasuunyi, ak ghoang'waanyi digheanyeeka eagoonyeegwa bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheanyangeagwa nidaah gidasin NG'UTAMIIDA aba giijeeda siguura Baal-beori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea agooga iyoowooschi doabiiw aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA goobeayi seayu ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula naanaaleagwa digheanyeeka sean ghoah gidarukuneani NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYU, asisiina mureeda aba ng'eanyiida jea aweayeena jeeda jea oombala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oang'waanya ak ghoadoabiiwji, gayghoah fughareengeagwa aba heeda buuneeda, hean iiy diigheanyeeksu sean gaygwayi, ‘huumwa gil eemeeni aasaang'a nea hees uurjeeni nea bareahi iheeni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwandeenu eemeeda hees uurjeeni mideawa aseeta neekeewa uurji NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA iinyo eeguursiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gwanda ana eemeeda suuk mideewa digheanyeeka doobiiweadi uurji suh ghamneawa earukuneegwa askweareaniin?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gifuri saseadaang'u ea gurooroadaang'u muuchi, abeeda ea maygwaroosiineey gidida aba gheanyangaagu, nea abeeda ea mayghang'amwa jeeda gurooroadaang'u aba jeeda eaweagaagu sean, anaala diibigaagu ea diibigeaba gaagu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gawuurji eaweeda eamiinaadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA aba uhuuda giijeeda Horebu, ak gwayeeshiineegwa NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Amughuusha buuneeda ghapka heeda eandi, ak hean gaydaanaal diigheanyeekeasu, abeeda geegoonan mureeda eawoojiga sean bea eaweega nyaawa aba badayda ng'eanyiida, ak hean gayghoanaal eara diibiga nyaawa ng'asheesu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooneekiichi, ak ghoamiinaadi aba geeshta giijeeda nea ghwayeada beasta ea ghwahita bugusta humng'eeda, nea gookwa misaneeda ea shamooghooda ea siilakghta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobalooleegwa NG'UTAMIIDA aba bugusta beasta, ghoayiinyi ghuutaanyi, nea niny ea meadaahi, geeghus ghuuta ak ghwahit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaanaaleegwa neajeadaanyi, goonyeegwa eang'waanya was digheanyeeka damanamughuush, ak hean gang'oorsa badayda beehaji iyeenya bea lagheanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukunean NG'UTAMIIDA aba damandida gichea daanaaleagwa digheanyeeka ea deaweedajeagaaschi ak abeeda goosinyi aba ng'eanyiida jea ookeawsiina ak goombali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miinda gheang'da aba sanaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ata goofurji geat, aba gideaba niny mii adaaha damanda abalooleegwa NG'UTAMIIDA, aba uhuuda giijeeda Horebu nyaasha bugusta beasta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "afura geat adiidu goosinyi riing'eeda aba gichea asina sanaamu, jea gawuurji ng'eedeeda ghana ea gatmooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghana gichea gawuurji diyeayda mida ng'eanyiida, ghana dariideanda dabiniga ng'eetiida bea humng'eeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gawuurji gilinyoo gabata jih ng'eanyi, uurji ghweayeega jeeda beega, was uuta ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gigatkadi gheanyangaagu ak ging'ulayi humng'eeda, ama inyas gidaahi (aseeta) ea sheeda ea miinga ea haleanjeeda sean bea humng'eeda adiidu gang'weela gheanyangaagu ak gibwadi haleanjeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA sissa eemoojiga suurja mida badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea niyeaneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gooruuneegwa jeeda duwayda gharinyeanda, aba ng'eanyiida Misri, ak ghoah fugaaschi ambal, ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwanyareeksean NG'UTAMIIDA aba ramaseandeang'wa ak gweaksean habeawooda nea gwayi, ang'iing'i majaghaawana eenda Yordani ea gideaba maydahita ng'eanyiida miy gooneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aniini gaydameewsa jeedeaba ng'eanyiini, aniini maydaaghaawa eenda Yordani, agooga gajoakghaawa ak goombalji ng'eanyiida miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean afura geat, adiidu gwarooseegwa neajeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA sinudayeeweegwa adoosinyi sanaamu uurji gili wassean weadaneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA gawuurji beasta ng'waan ghwarda gilinyoo ea gili, ASEETA ng'waan jih.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abeeda iyoojiili diibiga ea diibigeaba geagwa ak nea noopiidi ng'eanyiida aba gweanyeeka saang'a adiidu goosinyi riing'eeda aba sinooda sanaamu ak goosinyi gidamwadoabiiwa aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U abeeda gajoanyareasan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geamuschi haleanjeeda mida humng'eeda ea ng'eanyi gang'uleegwa eani, gideaba ghamneawa gajooshealana sean aba badayda ng'eanyiida jea ookghaawana eenda Yordani jea oombala, majoopiidana eawoojisu saang'a, iing'ata gajeehuydaneegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean NG'UTAMIIDA gaygoodearseegwa jeeda eemoojiga suurja, ak nea gajeepuuda fiisu ng'ay jeeda eemoojiga heeda jea googealeegwa NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba hoowa gajabwada gheawunga aseecheeka geediga ea lagheanga, gadiyoojiga geatinga buuneeda mwaamu ghwadaah ghana gwayiing'shi ghana gweagiischi ghana gwajoon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba hoowa gajagaassa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA ak gajanyasa iyoogasayi aba gurooruunatkeagwa sean ea aba jeesingeagwa sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda oondi jeeda hang'weanidooda, ak ghwanyasnyi ng'asheesu seaniin eawoojiga muudeanooda, gaybiiksiina NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ak gaysisiina mureeda ng'asheagaaschi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ea ASEETA bayiida fih gil, nea maygwanung'seey heeda nea ea maygahuydaneey nea ea maygwaroosa neajeeda ghayi aguuday habeawooda sea ghweanigeagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Anyaashta eawoojiga ning'ata, nea miyeejiilnyi, ng'eada eaweeda sina ASEETA siida aba badayda ng'eanyiida, ak ginyaashti gidang'eada murdeanagi bea muudeanooda humng'eeda ea gagul murdeeda niirja ea gwanda gil nuut uurji nih sidaah ghana ea siyiiy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gwanda fiisu aleeysiit ghuuta ASEETA aba bugusta beasta damanyoojiga sean, gawuurji gidiyiing'di ang'iing'i ak ea gudu gwandeawa eaweega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghana deepa gwanda aseeta wassean nigala geandeayda ng'eanyiida nea gaba geaw aba bugusta eemooji suuk, aba sawanaduutka, ea gwadeagwajeega, ea deamdeamanga, ghana aba ng'ucheeda, ghana aba geatinda mideawa uurda ghana aba geatinda siitoabiiw, ghana aba sawanaduutka hees, aba giduurji haleanjeeda sean ghayi sin NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA aba badahuukeagwa aba ng'eanyiida Misri aba madeeda gheanyangeagwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga siihiimneegwa ng'asheesu, gideaba gaynala gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA ASEETA gil, geeghus niny ak ghwahit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoayiinyi ghuutaanyi nea gwarina humng'eeda, ak ghoanaaleagwa gichea asisiina mureeda, nea aba badayda ng'eanyiida ghoahiimneegwa beasta haw, ak ghoayiinyi ng'asheagaaschi leabu bugusta beasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghayi ghabwariiy ghweanigeagwa ama ng'ata ghaghwal eara jeacheenga nyaawa, ak hean gooruuteaweegwa ng'eanyiida Misri niny gicha aba uurdaanyi haw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghahoana madeedeang'wa eemoojiga saang'a hees uurjeen naawaneegwa, ak gayghoahiitaneegwa ng'eanyiita, ak gagooneegwa ng'eanyiida nyaawa ahearana ak ghoah giduurji ea gagul ghamneawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean nala gidang'eada ghamneawa, ak giyiini gurooroadaang'u, gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA ASEETA gil, mida humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida; manda nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean sisiina mureeda digheanyeeka deaweedajeega eagoonyeey ghamneawa, ak abeeda ghwadoabiiw aba headaang'u ea diibiga jea jiila, ak abeeda gajoopiidana gweanyeeka saang'a aba ng'eanyiida goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U nea manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mujiinajeega simng'awsa aba gayeewda Yordani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwasach Musa mujiinaji samwagu aba heeda ghayeawa giigheawda eenda Yordani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea siisi ea siichea gwanuus giischeewoocheandaanyi, nea mabaysiina, nea ea miigafurji ghayi aba mwadi, nea iimang'awsa jeedeaba mujiinajeesu abeeda gayghoaghu eaweagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beseri mida jeeda dareapcheeda mida ng'eanyiida awiida bea eemeeda Rubeni, ea Ramoti mida Gileyadi bea eemeeda Gadi ea Golani mida Bashani bea eemeeda Manase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ashoohooda giidaydeayda diigheanyeeka ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh digheanyeeka adaw Musa fuga Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "suh ea girgweaksiinda gil ea digheanyeeka ea muuwuunooda rukusa Musa fuga Israeli damanda rinna ng'eanyiida Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "giigheawda eenda Yordani was moangoachiyda gal Bet-beori, ng'eanyiida Sihoni was sugoocheanda fuga Amori ambaliischi aba Heshboni, joar Musa ea fuga Israeli damanda rinna ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goombali ng'eanyiidaanyi ea dea Ogu was NG'UTAMIIDA ambaliischi aba Bashani, Ng'utamooji iyeenya bea eemeeda Amori ambaliischeewa gayeewda giigheawda eenda Yordani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghang'eada Arowa mida gheata mareeta moangoachiyda Arnoni ea ghwahita giijeeda siguura Siriyoni (was Hermoni) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ng'eanyiida sean bea Araba mida gayeew, giigheawda eenda Yordani ea ghwahita basooda Araba was guumda giijeeda Bisga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
